        }
      ],
      "title": "希望之种·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27012001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "三千万年前，你和我们一起毁灭世界。这才是你真正的样子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27012002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "迪迦！你的身份终究是属于黑暗的战士，重新加入我们，来征服这个世界吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27012003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27012004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "妈妈，快醒醒啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27012005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "妈妈，妈妈……求求你救救我妈妈。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27012006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "杀了那个女孩，唤醒真正属于你的力量吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27012007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27012008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嚯？没有重新选择黑暗，反而还想在我们的面前保护这个小女孩吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27012009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27012010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "没有了光明，被黑暗也唾弃，你觉得你会是我们的对手吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27012011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小蓝",
          "text": "一起上，解决它。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27012012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "很好，拍摄结束，大家最后再来个POSE做结尾吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯嗯嗯！大家一起来吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022003",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哉佩利敖光线！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "噢噢噢，真是太棒了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "即便化身黑暗，也要挣扎斗争，最后更是为了拯救弱小的女孩背水一战，是很感人的剧情呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小蓝",
          "text": "但我怎么感觉要被救的小女孩一点都不弱小。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "可恶，你以为本王想要演被救的小女孩吗，明明魔王的角色该是我才对。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "但是莉可你做魔王就太矮了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你说什么？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "我是说……这些细节就不用在意了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "看来效果还算不错，桑尼，观看人数多少了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "已经动用柯斯顿城的力量在宣传，人数正在持续的上涨中，转化器的充能很顺利。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27022013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "好，那么一鼓作气，收集下去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-594",
