      ],
      "title": "希望之种·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27013001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "计划很成功，光遗传因子转化器已经顺利完成能量收集了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "那么接下来，就是决定胜负的时候了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "光遗传因子转化器，启动！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "光的力量正在稳定的输出。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "一切都表现的很完美，看来我的奖金，啊不是，迪迦先生变回原来的模样有希望了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "光的力量已经输出完毕了，不过为什么，迪迦看上去……还是没什么变化的样子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "迪迦你要再试试自己的力量吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "……恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "诶诶诶，怎么会，明明吸收了光的力量，竟然失败了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "究竟是哪一步出了问题……明明我的计划很完善才对，难道是光的力量无法和迪迦先生的身体兼容吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这就有些麻烦了啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "艾伦兹，还有什么办法吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "啊。为什么突然问吾……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "因为艾伦兹之前说，很懂迪迦……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "那，那是当然！再给吾一些时间，吾肯定能想出办法，不过需要几天时间。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那就太好了，我们会期待艾伦兹的好消息的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "啊，哦……嗯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那么只能请迪迦再等待一段时间了，今天各位就只能暂时回去了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "可恶，接下来要怎么办才好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27013023",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "其实，艾伦兹根本就不懂迪迦。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-595",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
