        }
      ],
      "title": "希望之种·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27014001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "结果还是失败了啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我可没要你安慰我。失败了伤心的又不是我，",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "没法回到主人的身边，怎么说头疼的都该是你自己才对吧，哼！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "啰，啰嗦，我都是说了不用安慰我了，我才不会伤心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "不过你现打算怎么办，不能回去主人身边的话，就只能一直在外面流浪了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "不过我可以给你一个机会，要不要去我的地盘暂住？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "本王的磨坊堡还是很大的，如果你以后都没有地方去，我也可以再给你一个成为本王部下的机会。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "什么，你竟然要拒绝吗？哼，算了，这可是唯一的机会，你不愿意抓住可别怪我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "那你现在要去哪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "回去看看？为什么要做这种蠢事，难道你还觉得你的主人会来找你吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "哼，算了，那本王最后陪你走一遭吧，看看你绝望失落的样子也不错。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "到时候本王会狠狠嘲笑你的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "迪……迪迦……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "嗯？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27014019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这是什么声音。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
